Package: webbased-scanner-gui
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, nmap, sudo
Recommends: ffuf, gobuster
Maintainer: Lxcyfxr <https://github.com/Lxcyfxr>
Homepage: https://github.com/Lxcyfxr/webbased_scanner_gui
Description: Web-based GUI for network scanning and web fuzzing
 A web-based graphical interface for nmap and common web fuzzing tools
 (ffuf, feroxbuster, gobuster, wenum). Provides a browser-based UI for
 running scans, viewing live results, and exporting findings.
 .
 Accessible at http://localhost:8080 after installation.
